Layer Caching: The Key uv Docker Optimization
The two-step COPY + RUN pattern is why uv shines in CI/CD and rebuilds:


First build:  download + install all deps  →  ~2 min
Code change:  deps layer HIT from cache    →  ~5 sec
Dep change:   deps layer MISS, reinstall   →  ~30 sec (uv is fast)

# This layer is ONLY invalidated when pyproject.toml or uv.lock changes:
COPY pyproject.toml uv.lock ./
RUN uv sync --frozen --no-dev --no-install-project

# This layer runs on every code change, but it's just a file copy + project install:
COPY . .
RUN uv sync --frozen --no-dev
